@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+## Why
+
+Clients want to send only what changed between two versions of a JSON document rather than the whole new version. The library can apply RFC 6902 patches but cannot produce one.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `createPatch(from, to)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, returning a minimal RFC 6902 JSON Patch that turns `from` into `to` when applied with `applyPatch`.
+- Document it in `README.md`.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `json-patch`: adds a requirement for producing a patch from two document versions.
+
+## Impact
+
+- New code in `src/` and export in `src/index.ts`; new tests in `test/`; README section. No dependencies, no breaking changes.
